{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他怕追着要回应会搅坏好不容易有的亲近，对方也没答应过他什么。\",\n      \"key\": \"好不容易有的亲近\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"text\": \"他把心思转去想还能怎样关心对方，提醒自己真心盼对方好本身就让他开心。\",\n      \"key\": \"真心盼对方好\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"text\": \"想确认自己是否特别的紧张暂时退了，他不再掂量给了多少，也不怕显得更在乎，愿意多给一点。\",\n      \"key\": \"愿意多给一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\",\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得眼前的亲近就这样过去，又怕自己太热情会给对方压力，便收住一点。\",\n      \"key\": \"收住一点\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\",\n        \"B3\",\n        \"B4\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S04-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他还是把这阵轻松当成保证，以为只要不向对方要回应，就能尽情喜欢，也不会失去眼前的亲近。\",\n      \"key\": \"不会失去\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": []\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-2\",\n      \"rel\": \"说明\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-5\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-3\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S04-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R15\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S04-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他怕新期待破坏已有快乐、也知道对方没有承诺的事实，落到他不愿催促对方的具体顾虑。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R16\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S04-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"去掉像普遍关系原则的劝诫，保留他把心思转回关心对方、用真心盼对方好来安抚自己的做法。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R17\",\n        \"R18\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S04-3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并\",\n      \"why\": \"两条重复说投入增加，合并后保留紧张暂退、不再掂量给出多少、不怕显得更在乎；删去抽象的丰盈结论，用愿意多给一点保留具体变化。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R15\",\n        \"R17\",\n        \"R18\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S04-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"补足并压缩\",\n      \"why\": \"保留上一轮补出的必要拉扯，解释热情为何在高处收住、舍不得亲近过去又怕给对方压力；删去与 S04-3 重复的放开些去喜欢，避免再加一层心理步骤。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R19\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S04-5\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"保留并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留他把暂时有效的安抚误当成保证的过度推断，明确这是他当时的信念，为 S05 再次想知道自己是否被珍惜保留直接前提。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "cc3724aa-fcbf-44bd-a9e7-49f563640798", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T190243206813Z", "elapsed_seconds": 482.031, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T19:10:45.253475+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3ae42a77c615e98d87cad029109a5da3ec4b4086415b984437a630fedfbd3c2e", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_